				3
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Extract Telemetry DTOs into file-per-struct modules\n\nDecompose the `Source/RPC/Telemetry` module to align with the project-wide PascalCase file-per-struct convention. Extract `ServiceMetrics`, `TelemetryService`, and `TraceSpan` definitions from the monolithic module into dedicated `ServiceMetrics.rs`, `TelemetryService.rs`, and `TraceSpan.rs` files.\n\nEach file defines its core type as `Struct` to satisfy Tauri's `generate_handler!` macro symbol resolution requirements when referenced via the full module path. The `ServiceMetrics` and `TraceSpan` structs implement `Serialize` and `Deserialize` for gRPC/JSON payloads, while `TelemetryService` is initialized as a placeholder OTEL integration handle.\n\nThis establishes a consistent architectural pattern for the Telemetry service layer, mirroring recent refactors in Workspace, Vine, and Track modules.",
			"SHA": "6e5dd829a3bb81a889b0fc00f0470d6167f96bd2"
		}
